ている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、自分を養う為に働いている主人公に言及することもできず、思い悩んでいる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11466","sourceWorkId":"14321","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"伴斗唯一の身寄りである妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物心が付く前に両親を亡くしていて、子供の頃から伴斗とふたりで暮らしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、家事全般をこなすしっかり者に育ち、伴斗のだらしない行動を注意している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伴斗から諜報員関係のことは聞かされておらず、ただのサラリーマンだと聞いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、業務内容が曖昧であったり隠し事が多い様子から、伴斗の裏の顔に気づき始めている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"56517"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11466","sourceWorkId":"14321","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11466","sourceWorkId":"14321","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"50 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"11466","sourceWorkId":"14321","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4fcbc3deff6e9aa251329003991ce26dc545a9bb18c607bdb67d9be171f3986b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b9c418bb3257bb506bbd3d5b340f3ed85ff3144af8a2ea1d1678960865761f79.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"深田愛衣","creatorId":"vndb:s607","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s607","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s607","name":"深田 愛衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:50374:56517:6509:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c18352","characterName":"草壁 紗希","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"56518","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"50374"}],"egsCharacterIds":["11467"],"vndbCharacterId":"c18352"},"originalCharacterName":"草壁 紗希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"